<title>UK: Sun Life sells Exeter Bank to Sun Banking.</title>
<headline>Sun Life sells Exeter Bank to Sun Banking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial services group Sun Life and Provincial Holdings Plc said on Monday it had agreed to sell its Exeter Bank Ltd unit to Sun Banking Corporation Ltd for 11.65 million stg cash.</p>
<p>Sun Life said the sale price may be adjusted to the net assets of Exeter Bank when the deal is completed.</p>
<p>Exeter, which lends to the small business sector, had net assets of 14.6 million stg at the end of last year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
